  "body": "I know we're moving away from \"flags\", and I came across this one and it seemed simple enough to fix incrementally. Additionally, we can add a `data-x-\"concept-document-page-showing\"` for consistency with \"salvageability\", but I don't feel strongly.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11099/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 8, 2025, 6:57 PM UTC (e6e86eb)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11099/e6e914d...e6e86eb/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 8, 2025, 6:57 PM UTC (e6e86eb)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11099/document-lifecycle.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 8, 2025, 6:57 PM UTC (e6e86eb)\">/document-lifecycle.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11099/e6e914d...e6e86eb/document-lifecycle.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 8, 2025, 6:57 PM UTC (e6e86eb)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11099/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 8, 2025, 6:57 PM UTC (e6e86eb)\">/parsing.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11099/e6e914d...e6e86eb/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 8, 2025, 6:57 PM UTC (e6e86eb)\">diff</a> )",
